      "html": "<p>Work through this list, top to bottom, before the wheels turn.</p><p><ul><li><strong>Tyres:</strong> no cuts, bulges or exposed cord. Tread at or above the legal minimum. Spare checked. Wheel nuts tight.</li><li><strong>Wheels:</strong> no cracks, damage or rust. No loose nuts.</li><li><strong>Lights:</strong> head, brake, indicators, reversing, side, marker and number plate all work.</li><li><strong>Mirrors:</strong> all there, clean and set right. No cracks.</li><li><strong>Windscreen and wipers:</strong> no damage in the driver's view. Wipers work. Screen wash full.</li><li><strong>Horn:</strong> works.</li><li><strong>Fluids:</strong> engine oil, coolant, brake fluid and power steering fluid in range. No leaks under the vehicle.</li><li><strong>Fuel:</strong> enough for the day. No leak.</li><li><strong>Load:</strong> secure, within the weight limit, nothing hanging out. Curtain straps tight.</li><li><strong>Body and doors:</strong> no damage that could hurt anyone. Doors latch. No loose trim.</li><li><strong>Exhaust:</strong> no heavy smoke. Fixed firmly.</li><li><strong>Brakes:</strong> pedal feels normal. Air pressure builds. Parking brake holds. No pulling.</li><li><strong>Steering:</strong> no excess play. No odd noises on full lock.</li></ul></p>"
